ripped the guy apart in his jaws.

00:04:31.890 --> 00:04:35.290
I saw it. It happened right before my eyes!

00:04:45.140 --> 00:04:50.110
I see. Then, what other places
could Aoi have gone?

00:04:50.110 --> 00:04:52.440
Okay... Okay...

00:04:52.940 --> 00:04:54.740
Thank you very much.

00:06:02.780 --> 00:06:05.440
Gimme a break! Fuck funerals!

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:08.650
I'm gonna crush your little funeral here!

00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:11.580
What the hell kind of person are you?!

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:13.990
What about you?

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:17.430
What did you ever do for Mom
when she was suffering?

00:06:17.660 --> 00:06:20.470
Were you too busy golfing with
the higher-ups? Is that it?

00:06:20.470 --> 00:06:22.870
Is that how important work is to you?

00:06:22.870 --> 00:06:27.960
Then I'll tear it all apart, along with
your precious reputation!

00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:40.690
Hey! What do you think you're doing?!

00:06:40.690 --> 00:06:45.680
It's me, Daigo. Yuuya Daigo, your boss's son!

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:50.020
If you got a problem, go tell my old man about it!

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:56.300
Daigo...

00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:58.670
Is he on his way to becoming a demon for real?

00:06:58.900 --> 00:07:01.840
He turned into a white demon.
That's what you said, isn't it?

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:06.040
Would that be the power of Byakko,
the White Tiger?

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:08.540
