00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:19.880
There is a power that exists in this world,
known as the Golden Dragon.

00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:23.760
It is a great power which is at
the heart of all creation.

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:28.600
It is said that those who are endowed with
this power will control the world.

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:31.800
However, in order for the power of the
Golden Dragon to become manifest,

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:35.440
four other powers that protect
it must be invoked:

00:07:35.440 --> 00:07:35.940
Seiryuu, Suzaku, Gembu and Byakko.

