And when all four powers have
been properly invoked,

00:07:52.020 --> 00:07:54.960
peace will come to this world.

00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:58.320
Then, does this mean Lord Daigo
is this "Byakko"?

00:07:58.560 --> 00:07:59.890
Him?

00:08:00.170 --> 00:08:01.960
Stop talking about this!

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:10.430
You're wrong! That thing wasn't Daigo!

00:08:11.710 --> 00:08:14.370
I'm sorry! I'm sorry, Daigo.

00:08:14.910 --> 00:08:16.720
This is all my fault for being careless.

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:18.150
Komaki...

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:37.760
Ouch...

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:39.600
Damn...

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:42.800
Huh? What the...

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:50.040
Those are Tatsuma's and Komaki's...

00:09:04.760 --> 00:09:07.130
Ain't anyone here?

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:13.600
Where the heck am l?

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:17.910
Oh, my...

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:20.580
Please return to Master Miroku's workshop.

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:23.450
I can't have you out here
looking the way you do.

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:24.880
Huh?

00:09:27.520 --> 00:09:29.320
No way!

00:09:29.890 --> 00:09:31.820
Where the heck is this?

00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:34.160
Oh, so you're awake, are you?

00:09:38.060 --> 00:09:40.690
You're that guy from before!

00:09:43.570 --> 00:09:45.370
Looks like I owe you one.

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:48.340
I dunno who you are, but thanks a lot, man.

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:49.970
Where are you headed?

00:09:49.970 --> 00:09:54.210
I've gotta go. There's a guy I've gotta
beat no matter what it takes.

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:58.040
You think you can beat him as you are now?

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:03.120
How did you...

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:05.090
My friends are waiting for me!

00:10:05.090 --> 00:10:07.350
I don't have time to be squirmin' around here!

00:10:10.160 --> 00:10:11.920
I'll be borrowing this.

00:10:14.530 --> 00:10:16.020
Let go, dammit!

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:19.300
You old goat!

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:27.070
What the hell are you doing?!

00:10:27.280 --> 00:10:31.270
One with courage does not go off to die in vain.

00:10:31.780 --> 00:10:33.310
You...

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:52.540
What does he expect me to do?

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:59.840
I see... So, they were all taken in, huh?

00:11:00.650 --> 00:11:02.940
My stinkin' dad tipped the cops off.

00:11:03.650 --> 00:11:05.820
I can't put up with him any more.

00:11:05.820 --> 00:11:07.350
No kidding.

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:09.750
But more importantly, what about
those injuries of yours?

00:11:09.750 --> 00:11:14.160
Oh, well, I can't handle my old man anymore.

00:11:14.630 --> 00:11:17.390
He's gonna kill me at this rate.

00:11:19.100 --> 00:11:22.830
He's going down, I'm gonna kill him.

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:24.770
Magatsu...

00:11:26.170 --> 00:11:28.000
You promised me, y'know?

00:11:28.310 --> 00:11:31.210
That we'd always stick together?

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:34.510
That was a promise, right?

00:11:36.310 --> 00:11:37.820
Stick together, huh?

00:11:37.820 --> 00:11:41.950
That's right, together. We'll go down together.

00:11:41.950 --> 00:11:45.750
You and me, let's go to Hell together.

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:48.330
Right, Yuu?

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:51.520
Traitor!

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:56.790
Daigo!

00:11:57.540 --> 00:12:04.840
I'm sorry, there's nothing I can do,
but I'm here for you.

00:12:06.740 --> 00:12:10.850
As I thought, you've arrived at the same
conclusion, haven't you, Doshin?

00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:15.250
Yeah, we should assume that the Martial Fist
has fallen into his clutches.

00:12:15.650 --> 00:12:18.320
Has another Star of Fate fallen?

00:12:19.790 --> 00:12:22.020
Togo Narutaki...

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:27.650
Innocence, with simple innocence.

00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:33.240
No way!

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:34.600
Damn!

00:12:36.910 --> 00:12:38.170
Ah, hell...

00:12:40.410 --> 00:12:41.780
Daddy...

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:43.510
Daddy!

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:46.740
Daddy! Daddy!

00:13:02.770 --> 00:13:05.030
I'm not gonna put up with assholes.

00:13:05.770 --> 00:13:07.700
I'm not gonna put up with ya!

00:13:10.110 --> 00:13:11.540
Tryin' to fuck with us?!

00:13:13.010 --> 00:13:16.640
Oh, is it cold, little boy?

00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:23.590
Hey, c'mon kiddie, what's the matter?

00:13:26.290 --> 00:13:28.330
Y..You little shit!

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:30.260
Doesn't know when to quit, does he?

00:13:30.260 --> 00:13:32.790
Maybe we need to cut off two or three fingers?

00:13:33.060 --> 00:13:34.200
That's enough.

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:35.100
Huh?

00:13:35.100 --> 00:13:36.570
Who the hell are you?

00:13:36.570 --> 00:13:37.900
Get him!

00:13:42.770 --> 00:13:45.570
Kyo.. Kyouichi Houraiji!

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:49.810
Kamui, Kyoshiro Kamui...

00:13:56.350 --> 00:13:57.950
A monster?

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:01.730
Dammit!

00:14:01.730 --> 00:14:05.960
Once more... Once more!

00:14:13.970 --> 00:14:16.870
Once more... Once more!

00:14:21.410 --> 00:14:23.180
So, you're Daigo, aren't ya?

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:26.240
And you're the Kabukicho samurai for hire, huh?

00:14:32.520 --> 00:14:34.920
Damn... Damn, damn!

00:14:35.160 --> 00:14:37.680
Why? Tell me why!

00:14:40.530 --> 00:14:42.860
Where is your sword pointed?

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:45.700
Your past?

00:14:46.870 --> 00:14:48.630
Revenge for your father?

00:14:52.210 --> 00:14:57.240
The one who's taken the edge off
that sword is you, yourself.

00:14:58.880 --> 00:15:00.150
What?

00:15:00.150 --> 00:15:04.450
Your sword wasn't pointed at me.

00:15:13.030 --> 00:15:15.000
He's gotten into a good rhythm, hasn't he?

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:18.670
Yes, it's rather pleasant.

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:25.430
Oh, brother...

00:15:28.180 --> 00:15:30.170
I knew it wouldn't work.

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:37.990
Those are...

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:49.590
The Oribe compound keeps the
nonhuman out, does it?

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:55.730
Seventeen years... That's a long time for us.

00:15:58.080 --> 00:16:01.240
Well, then, on to the other job.

00:16:04.880 --> 00:16:09.580
A spiritual field of ultimate protection?
Think they're clever, do they?

00:16:13.560 --> 00:16:14.830
He's coming!

00:16:14.830 --> 00:16:17.400
He has the power to shatter your field.

00:16:17.400 --> 00:16:20.260
Yes, and that clears things up.

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:24.130
There's no doubt now: our enemy is...

00:16:30.580 --> 00:16:34.350
They're all here. That simplifies things.

00:16:34.350 --> 00:16:36.380
These are the last of the Martial Fist's assassins.

00:16:36.380 --> 00:16:38.470
We'll avenge the Twenty-Eight
Constellations now!

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:39.680
Let's go!

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:40.920
Right!

00:16:40.920 --> 00:16:43.990
Leave the fighting to me.
You take care of Daigo, Komaki!

00:16:43.990 --> 00:16:45.390
Okay!

00:17:09.350 --> 00:17:13.720
It must have been painful.
You must have been so lonely.

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:15.320
I'm so sorry.

00:17:15.320 --> 00:17:18.380
Forgive me, forgive me!

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:33.470
I can't do it.

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:37.170
It's no use, I just can't do it!

00:17:38.480 --> 00:17:39.780
Magatsu!

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:41.510
Open up, it's me!

00:17:42.350 --> 00:17:45.080
Is it really that much of an emergency?

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:48.180
Please, before it's too late!

00:17:48.590 --> 00:17:50.820
No way around it, huh?

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:56.460
Magatsu...

00:17:59.200 --> 00:18:00.600
Magatsu!

00:18:00.600 --> 00:18:02.030
Hey, Magatsu!

00:18:02.500 --> 00:18:03.670
Hey!

00:18:03.670 --> 00:18:04.970
He's not moving.

00:18:05.370 --> 00:18:09.830
He's stopped moving.
Just like a rock now, like a rock...

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:16.550
He got colder bit by bit,
until he was like a damn rock.

00:18:18.380 --> 00:18:22.550
I did it! I was able to kill him!

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:25.850
He won't be moving anymore, y'know?

00:18:27.430 --> 00:18:29.120
Yuu?

00:18:31.330 --> 00:18:33.160
Y..You're wrong!

00:18:34.570 --> 00:18:36.330
You're wrong!

00:18:36.330 --> 00:18:39.270
You've got it wrong, Magatsu!

00:18:40.640 --> 00:18:43.160
You were all I had!

00:18:43.670 --> 00:18:46.180
Snap out of it! Open your eyes!

00:18:46.180 --> 00:18:49.550
Daigo, you can't turn into that again!

00:18:49.550 --> 00:18:52.050
You're wrong! You're wrong!

00:18:52.050 --> 00:18:55.040
Together, we'll go down together.

00:18:55.520 --> 00:18:59.510
You and me, let's go to Hell together.

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:05.330
This is...

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:06.100
No!

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:06.360
It's started?
No!

00:19:06.360 --> 00:19:07.260
It's started?

00:19:07.260 --> 00:19:08.900
Th..This is...

00:19:08.900 --> 00:19:10.130
He's metamorphosing into Byakko!

00:19:10.130 --> 00:19:11.270
Daigo!

00:19:11.270 --> 00:19:11.770
No!

00:19:11.770 --> 00:19:12.900
You can't!
No!

00:19:17.640 --> 00:19:19.040
No way...

00:19:19.710 --> 00:19:21.470
No way!

00:19:22.610 --> 00:19:24.810
This way, mister demon.

00:19:25.150 --> 00:19:26.820
Hey, this guy's...

00:19:26.820 --> 00:19:28.220
A demon hunter?!

00:19:29.650 --> 00:19:31.960
An offering to your deceased, you take it.

00:19:31.960 --> 00:19:33.890
This is Houraiji's...

00:19:33.890 --> 00:19:36.090
Fuckin' asshole!

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:38.090
Nice mouth...

00:19:38.500 --> 00:19:40.930
Don't you speak like that to me.

00:19:46.800 --> 00:19:50.100
I'll protect you, Sakurai!

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:56.270
Arrows...

00:19:56.780 --> 00:19:58.680
Arrows!

00:19:58.680 --> 00:20:00.150
I want...

00:20:02.020 --> 00:20:03.040
...my arrows!

00:20:27.010 --> 00:20:28.410
Daigo...

00:20:29.810 --> 00:20:31.350
Big sister, your barrier!

00:20:31.350 --> 00:20:32.320
Gotcha!

00:20:41.690 --> 00:20:43.220
Seek!

00:20:53.300 --> 00:20:54.740
And you are?

00:20:54.740 --> 00:20:58.570
Yuuya D..Daigo...

00:20:58.780 --> 00:21:02.210
I see, so you're Daigo, huh?

00:21:02.480 --> 00:21:05.850
I'm Komaki Sakurai. Nice to meet you.

00:21:05.850 --> 00:21:07.580
Um, yeah!

00:21:08.320 --> 00:21:11.380
Daigo! Daigo!

00:21:12.020 --> 00:21:13.920
Daigo!

00:21:47.530 --> 00:21:51.430
Well? Has this been a wonderful
memory for you?

00:21:52.330 --> 00:21:55.560
You regret ever having had power, don't you?

00:21:56.430 --> 00:21:59.230
Regret? Dunno the meaning of the word.

00:22:01.610 --> 00:22:03.010
You!

00:22:03.010 --> 00:22:04.740
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:22:04.740 --> 00:22:06.140
Kyouichi!

00:22:06.440 --> 00:22:07.570
Kyouichi!

00:22:07.950 --> 00:22:09.450
Kyouichi!

00:22:09.450 --> 00:22:11.140
You were alive?

00:22:13.080 --> 00:22:16.950
Sorry to disappoint you, but the hero never dies.

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:21.550
I'm delighted.
Now, give me some more entertainment.

00:22:24.400 --> 00:22:26.830
Put a lid on it, ya perverted ass.

00:22:28.030 --> 00:22:31.230
You have now attained an
unflinching, unwavering heart.

00:22:32.070 --> 00:22:34.060
Haven't you?

00:22:41.910 --> 00:22:47.020
I sadly hung my head a bit

00:22:47.020 --> 00:22:51.720
And finally you murmured

00:22:52.120 --> 00:22:56.360
What I heard was a faint goodbye

00:22:56.360 --> 00:23:01.300
Said with all your might

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:12.510
Our pulses echo in the awkward silence

00:23:12.510 --> 00:23:14.380
We can see each other again

00:23:14.380 --> 00:23:16.880
Let's meet up again some time

00:23:16.880 --> 00:23:22.690
Let's each set out in search of our own futures

00:23:22.690 --> 00:23:27.190
For the kindness you gave me for my heartache

00:23:27.190 --> 00:23:31.630
I thank you now

00:23:32.800 --> 00:23:37.430
These flower petals seem just as if

00:23:37.430 --> 00:23:38.870
They were blessing us

00:23:38.870 --> 00:23:43.070
As we depart on our journeys

00:23:43.070 --> 00:23:47.440
I won't forget your warmth

00:23:47.440 --> 00:23:51.900
That overwhelmed my loneliness

00:23:52.720 --> 00:23:57.810
I thank you now

00:24:06.700 --> 00:24:07.490
Next Episode

